  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-12-08T19:34:43.939Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Implement the ability to set specific users to moderate users for you specifically for your account.\n\nWould be useful for streamers, live performers, stage speakers, or anything requiring public world moderation to keep the integrity of a performance or event.\n\nFor example: \n\nWhile a performer is performing, it is very common for troublesome users to interrupt the the performance (especially in public worlds). It usually begins with them yelling obscenities and being as loud as possible. Instead of having to stop the performance and block the user, another specified user can block or mute them for me so that there would be no interruption on my end / broadcast.",
